      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target community is individuals who support gun rights and hold strong pro-gun control positions, often associated with rural, traditional, or conservative political identities. The cowboy attire and the refusal to debate gun control with 'folks who eat soap and are confused on which pisser to use' are designed to resonate with those who identify with or sympathize with the gun rights movement and who view opponents of gun control as mentally incompetent or irrational. The meme uses stereotypes and derogatory language to appeal to an audience that is politically aligned with gun ownership and may be frustrated with what they perceive as the irrationality or ignorance of gun control advocates.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
